    # unconditional-branch offset D = unconditional_transformer - transformer of the task's own folder - UNC_ALPHA x D exactly
    # as '.diff' / '.diff_b' for the non-matrix tensors, UNC_ALPHA x a rank-UNC_RANK SVD of D for the fp8 matrices (unc_build,
    # unc_prepare, unc_writer). UNC_TRAIN 1 (needs UNC): the same component is merged into the in-memory base through the
